Stage 1 (Current)

You already did:

✅ Tiny GPT2 Fine-Tuning

Learn:

Dataset
Tokenization
Training
Inference
Stage 2

Learn LoRA concept.

Understand:

Base Model
+
Adapter


No coding yet.

Stage 3

Use TinyLlama

Learn:

PEFT
LoRA
Trainer

